",{"id":308,"href":309,"linkText":310},"aMKG1xIAACAAPQAR","\u002Ffaqs\u002Fsending-a-parcel\u002Fhow-to-contact-customer-services-for-international-parcels","How to contact customer services for international parcels",{"categoryUid":312,"categoryTitle":313,"linkedPages":314},"lockers","Lockers",[315,319,323,327,330,333],{"id":316,"href":317,"linkText":318},"YhzQ2hIAACkA7YHk","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fcan-i-get-my-parcel-delivered-to-a-locker","Can I get my parcel delivered to a Locker?",{"id":320,"href":321,"linkText":322},"YhzTYRIAAC4A7Y0l","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fthe-locker-is-too-small-for-my-parcel-what-can-i-do","The locker is too small for my parcel, what can I do?",{"id":324,"href":325,"linkText":326},"YhzT2BIAAC0A7Y9S","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fwhat-is-a-locker","What is a Locker?",{"id":328,"href":12,"linkText":329},"YhzSehIAACkA7Yjg","I'm having trouble with the Locker, what can I do?",{"id":331,"href":17,"linkText":332},"YhzRghIAACkA7YTp","How do I use a Locker?",{"id":334,"href":335,"linkText":336},"YhzS9RIAAC0A7Ysk","\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fmy-barcode-isnt-scanning","My barcode isn't scanning","my-barcode-isnt-scanning",{"titleTag":339,"metaDescription":340,"canonical":341,"subpath2":342,"category":351,"linkText":336,"additionalHelp":6,"slices":359},"My barcode isn't scanning | FAQs | Evri","Using Evri Lockers to send, collect and return parcels is easy. If your barcode doesn't work though, here's how you can get support.","my-barcode-isnt-scanning.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffaqs\u002Flockers\u002Fmy-barcode-isnt-scanning",{"id":343,"type":344,"tags":345,"lang":346,"slug":312,"first_publication_date":347,"last_publication_date":347,"uid":312,"link_type":348,"key":349,"isBroken":350},"Yhj0nxIAACkA3Cgw","subpath2",[],"en-gb","2022-02-25T15:24:19+0000","Document","1d3b2e08-aea2-4849-8138-a5cfc1ebe024",false,{"id":352,"type":353,"tags":354,"lang":346,"slug":312,"first_publication_date":356,"last_publication_date":357,"uid":312,"link_type":348,"key":358,"isBroken":350},"YituGBEAACsAQzK1","faq-category",[355],"FAQs","2022-03-11T15:43:53+0000","2022-05-12T12:57:42+0000","3f347529-b764-41eb-bbe3-bc3fba8765ae",[360],{"variation":361,"version":362,"items":363,"primary":365,"id":412,"slice_type":413,"slice_label":414},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[364],{},{"content":366},[367,372,380,386,392,395,399,402],{"type":368,"text":369,"spans":370,"direction":371},"heading1","My barcode isn’t scanning - what should I do?",[],"ltr",{"type":373,"text":374,"spans":375,"direction":371},"paragraph","If your barcode isn’t scanning at the Locker, don’t worry - we’re here to help. ",[376],{"start":377,"end":378,"type":379},38,44,"strong",{"type":373,"text":381,"spans":382,"direction":371},"First, try entering the 16-digit barcode manually using the keypad on the Locker screen. This usually solves the issue. ",[383],{"start":384,"end":385,"type":379},24,49,{"type":373,"text":387,"spans":388,"direction":371},"If it still doesn’t work or you're experiencing other problems, you can get support directly from the Locker. Just tap the “Help” button on the terminal for step-by-step assistance or contact details for our Locker support team. ",[389],{"start":390,"end":391,"type":379},123,152,{"type":373,"text":393,"spans":394,"direction":371},"",[],{"type":396,"text":397,"spans":398,"direction":371},"heading2","Need help with a QR code at a ParcelShop? ",[],{"type":373,"text":400,"spans":401,"direction":371},"No problem! If your QR code isn’t scanning at the Print in ParcelShop device, you can still print your label quickly and easily by entering your 6-character Print in ParcelShop code on the touchscreen. ",[],{"type":373,"text":403,"spans":404,"direction":371},"If you’ve lost your label or Print in ParcelShop code, see our FAQ with steps on how to find it. ",[405,411],{"start":406,"end":407,"type":408,"data":409},63,66,"hyperlink",{"link_type":10,"url":273,"target":410},"_blank",{"start":406,"end":407,"type":379},"r